{"title": "Helm (deity)", "pageid": 47308, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Helm_(deity)", "categories": ["Gods"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title\" data-source=\"name\">Helm</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"title\">\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The Watcher<br>God of Guardians</div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-media-collection\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<ul class=\"pi-media-collection-tabs\">\n\t\t<li class=\"pi-tab-link pi-item-spacing current\" data-pi-tab=\"pi-tab-1\">Symbol</li><li class=\"pi-tab-link pi-item-spacing\" data-pi-tab=\"pi-tab-2\">Statue</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t\t<div class=\"pi-media-collection-tab-content current\" id=\"pi-tab-1\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Sticker_Deities_Helm.webp\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Symbol\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Sticker_Deities_Helm.webp/300px-Sticker_Deities_Helm.webp\" srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Sticker_Deities_Helm.webp/300px-Sticker_Deities_Helm.webp 1x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Sticker_Deities_Helm.webp/600px-Sticker_Deities_Helm.webp 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Symbol\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"pi-media-collection-tab-content\" id=\"pi-tab-2\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/w/images/c/c6/Helm_Statue.webp\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Statue\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Helm_Statue.webp/300px-Helm_Statue.webp\" srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Helm_Statue.webp/300px-Helm_Statue.webp 1x, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Helm_Statue.webp/600px-Helm_Statue.webp 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Statue\" width=\"270\" height=\"352\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t</div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Stats</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deity\">Deity</a></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n<b>Helm</b> is the <a href=\"/wiki/God\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"God\">god</a> of protection and guardians, lawful neutral. He is associated with the domains <a href=\"/wiki/Life_Domain\" title=\"Life Domain\">Life</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Light_Domain\" title=\"Light Domain\">Light</a>, Twilight.\n\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r356266\">.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{display:grid;margin:10px 4px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{padding:8px 16px;margin:auto}@media screen and (max-width:779px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-top:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-left:0!important;grid-row:2;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:3;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{justify-content:center!important}}@media screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: center\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 80px; height: 80px; clip-path: xywh(0 0 100% 100% round 15%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><img src=\"/w/images/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 110%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">Honour. Duty. She brought me back to Helm - she saved my life.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a href=\"/wiki/Helm-Embossed_Journal\" title=\"Helm-Embossed Journal\">Helm-Embossed Journal</a></div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>Helm, the Watcher is an eternal sentry among the gods, representing guardians across the planes. After more than a century of fading worship, Helm's power was restored with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Second_Sundering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Second Sundering\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Second_Sundering\">Second Sundering</a></span>. \n</p><p>This deity can be selected by all player character <a href=\"/wiki/Cleric\" title=\"Cleric\">Clerics</a> except <a href=\"/wiki/Lolth-sworn_Drow\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lolth-sworn Drow\">Lolth-sworn Drow</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Blessings\">Blessings</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helm%27s_Protection\" title=\"Helm's Protection\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Helm's Protection\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Helm%27s_Protection\" title=\"Helm's Protection\">Helm's Protection</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_characters\">Related characters</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Adrielle\" title=\"Adrielle\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Portrait_Adrielle.png/30px-Portrait_Adrielle.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Portrait_Adrielle.png/45px-Portrait_Adrielle.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Portrait_Adrielle.png/60px-Portrait_Adrielle.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Adrielle\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Portrait_Adrielle.png/30px-Portrait_Adrielle.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Portrait_Adrielle.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Adrielle\" title=\"Adrielle\">Adrielle</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Valeria\" title=\"Valeria\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png/30px-Portrait_Valeria.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png/45px-Portrait_Valeria.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png/60px-Portrait_Valeria.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Valeria\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png/30px-Portrait_Valeria.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a 